{"code":200,"text":"OK","success":true,"data":{"id":204923,"excludedCurrencies":null,"title":"Bonus Policy and Rules","content":"<p><strong>BETSSEN GENERAL BONUS POLICY<\/strong><\/p>\n\n<p>BETSSEN offers a variety of attractive bonuses which you can check on our Promotions page.<\/p>\n\n<p>All listed bonuses fall under the following rules and limits:<\/p>\n\n<p>1. All bonuses of Users are limited individually to one person, home address, telephone number and e-mail address, one bill as well as the device being used to benefit from Casino services.<br \/>\n2. The company has the right to refuse providing any current bonus to any User or group of Users upon its own discretion.<br \/>\n3. Bonus programs are available only to Users who have made a deposit in real currency to their account in BETSSEN.<\/p>\n\n<p>4. In case of violation or bonus violation BETSSEN reserves the right to deprive these Users from a bonus and void the remainders or generated winnings. For the purposes of protection against fraud the company has the right to demand a document from the client proving identity before crediting a bonus.<\/p>\n\n<p>5. For the given bonuses, the company does not accept any complains related to mistakenly placed sports bets by a player, miscalculation of the wagering by a player and compensation of the bonus into real balance.<\/p>\n\n<p>6. Withdrawals of bonus winnings are allowed for verified and deposited accounts only.<\/p>\n\n<p>7. Jackpot winnings during wagering of no deposit bonus will not be credited and forfeited upon wagering. As well as Jackpot winnings considered void if played from any resources other than deposit funds only<\/p>\n\n<p>8. All bets made from winnings from no deposit bonus (exceeding the highest limit defined by the Casino) will be voided.<\/p>\n\n<p>9. Casino can void all the winnings from bonus remainder (regardless of bonus validity timeline) at any time upon its own discretion without notifying a player in prior if a gaming profile is detected in violation or suspicious activity.<\/p>\n\n<p>10. Winnings which took place during the technical issues\/maintenance on the Casino platform or on the provider&#39;s side might be announced void.<br \/>\n11. For all free entry tournaments without chip &ndash;in and deposit, players allowed to instantly withdraw up to &euro;\/$100 from the tournament winning amount. Any winnings over &euro;\/$100 generated from that will be deducted.<\/p>\n\n<p><br \/>\n<strong>NO DEPOSIT BONUS POLICY<\/strong><\/p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>All new and\/or existing customers will qualify for a no deposit offer every once in a while upon Casino decision only.<\/li>\n\t<li>Offers availability will be announced by Casino via any channel the Casino finds necessary.<\/li>\n\t<li>Each offer has its own description, conditions and validity, yet regardless of those &ndash; any no deposit bonus maximum payout is set to &euro;\/$ 30 or equivalent in other currency<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n<p><strong>Welcome Deposit Bonuses<\/strong><\/p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>All Welcome Deposit Bonuses which have wagering conditions have the same payout limit regardless of the initial bonus amount provided.<\/li>\n\t<li>The maximum payout here is the definition of the converted bonus+ deposit remainders ( including winnings) upon meeting the wagering condition.<\/li>\n\t<li>Maximum payout: &euro;\/$ 2,000 (total amount that applies to the package maximum, meaning if this max is reached upon benefiting from one of the offered welcome offers then the rest of welcome offers become unavailable).<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n<p><strong>Daily Bonuses General Rules<\/strong><\/p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>All Daily Deposit Bonuses regardless of the type and deposit method have the same general rules , which are the following:<\/li>\n\t<li>Player cannot have more than 1 bonus linked to the current deposit at a time<\/li>\n\t<li>All deposit bonuses have the maximum bonus amount limits and particular wagering conditions described on its promotional page.<\/li>\n\t<li>Each deposit can qualify for 1 product&rsquo;s deposit bonus only , meaning a player depositing once can choose only 1 particular deposit bonus and benefit from it.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n<p><br \/>\n<strong>Daily Deposit Bonus offers:<\/strong><\/p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>BETSSEN offers variety of different daily bonuses. Players can benefit from any upon their choice by claiming it before depositing.<\/li>\n\t<li>Daily deposit bonuses number per player is limited to 1 daily.<\/li>\n\t<li>This includes the official offers published in the website and also occasional ones posted and informed to the certain group of players via other channels.<\/li>\n\t<li>The maximum payout (withdrawable) from both (wagered deposit + wagered bonus) is capped at 2,000 USD\/Euro (or equivalent).<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n<p><strong>Daily Cashback offers:<\/strong><\/p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>BETSSEN appreciates its loyal customers by providing them additional funds to keep playing.<\/li>\n\t<li>Each day all qualifying players will receive Daily Cashback Bonuses in different products based on the previous day activity.<\/li>\n\t<li>Bonus&nbsp;Max payout is limited depending on players&#39; loyalty levels and submitted to each level its own.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n<p><strong>Weekly and Monthly Deposit Bonuses General Rules<\/strong><\/p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Each player can benefit from welcome, daily, weekly bonuses upon their own discretion within the limits set for each offer they activate. Yet the long time bonuses limits (weekly and monthly) has a prevailing power over the offers. E.G. If a player has won twice from daily deposit offer where the limit is &euro;\/$ 500 , they also reach the weekly limit of &euro;\/$ 1,000 and lo longer eligible for any other offers during the current week.<\/li>\n\t<li>Weekly based Deposit Bonus Max payout: &euro;\/$ 1,000<\/li>\n\t<li>Mothly-based Deposit Bonus Max payout:&nbsp;&nbsp;&euro;\/$ 2,000<\/li>\n\t<li>Monthly-based Deposit Bonus Max Payout: &euro;\/$ 2,000 ( total of all bonuses activated and used)- refers to converted amount of all bonuses paid and withdrawn.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n<p><strong>Extra (Custom) Bonus Policy<\/strong><\/p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Since BETSSEN offers a huge bonus portfolio, players have a diverse choice of bonuses on daily basis.<\/li>\n\t<li>Casino does not provide additional bonuses upon player&rsquo;s request as a general rule.<\/li>\n\t<li>If Casino makes exceptions, it should not be accepted as a common re-occurring rule but as an exception and appreciation gesture to its loyal customers.<\/li>\n\t<li>Only Casino may decide which customer&rsquo;s request to satisfy for extra bonus request based on a customer&rsquo;s gaming, deposit activity.<\/li>\n\t<li>Such requests go through a thorough review which might take up to 24 hours each<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n","metaDescription":null,"metaTitle":null,"metaUrl":null}}